67
00:05:02,290 --> 00:05:05,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hate bad things.</font>

68
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What nonsense is this?!</font>

69
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:12,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your time to work has finally come!</font>

70
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:18,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I know that you are all doing bad things.</font>

71
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:23,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Holding the old man from the village
