72
00:05:23,530 --> 00:05:25,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Enough of this impertinence!</font>

73
00:05:25,370 --> 00:05:28,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We, the Red Ribbon Army,
