75
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:35,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I cannot do it. I am sorry.</font>

76
00:05:35,710 --> 00:05:39,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! You shoddily made wimp!</font>

77
00:05:42,410 --> 00:05:49,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, if you're not going to listen to me,
