90
00:06:52,550 --> 00:06:56,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir, General White!</font>

91
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:59,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Outta my way, Useless!</font>

92
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:04,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'll explode you,
