<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I go!</font>

97
00:07:19,020 --> 00:07:21,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't let you!</font>

98
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:40,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You brat! How dare you
