<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Me? I'm Son Goku. And you?</font>

110
00:08:39,770 --> 00:08:46,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My name... I am called Artificial Human #8.</font>

111
00:08:46,450 --> 00:08:47,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That sure is complicated.</font>

112
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:54,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's "Whatever #8" mean?
