<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah!</font>

115
00:09:02,230 --> 00:09:05,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is no time to be doing this, is it?</font>

116
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,630
