122
00:10:36,890 --> 00:10:38,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will come with you.</font>

123
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:40,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! You know about this place?!</font>

124
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:44,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was once shown a map. Do not worry.</font>

125
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:46,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's nice of you.</font>

126
00:10:46,260 --> 00:10:49,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks a lot!</font>

127
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:51,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is my way of
thanking you for saving me.</font>

128
00:11:02,050 --> 00:11:07,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It seems to me like you can't escape,
