129
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:11,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would be terrible if
one got lost in this maze.</font>

130
00:11:11,050 --> 00:11:13,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey. This way.</font>

131
00:11:16,290 --> 00:11:18,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, Ha-<i>chan</i>, is this the 5th floor?</font>

132
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:22,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is between the 4th and 5th floors.</font>

133
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:28,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, what is "Ha-<i>chan</i>"?</font>

134
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? It's you.</font>

135
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:34,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's hard to say
"Whatever #8" ["<i>Hachi-go</i>"], so...</font>

136
00:11:34,810 --> 00:11:37,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>?</font>

137
00:11:37,310 --> 00:11:40,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>... Ha-<i>chan</i>...</font>

138
00:11:40,580 --> 00:11:42,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I like that!</font>

139
00:11:42,650 --> 00:11:46,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>... Ha-<i>chan</i>?</font>

140
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:48,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Strange guy.</font>

141
00:11:56,370 --> 00:11:59,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This room is the 5th floor.</font>

142
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:05,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's all one big wall...
Can't we get inside?</font>

143
00:12:05,110 --> 00:12:08,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is no entrance to the 5th floor.</font>

144
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:12,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It is a secret room. Even I
do not know what is inside it.</font>

145
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is the 6th floor control room.</font>

146
00:12:21,990 --> 00:12:24,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The room where the old man
from the village is being held.</font>

147
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:26,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

148
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:32,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're the boss!</font>

149
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:37,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give back the village chief!</font>

150
00:12:37,370 --> 00:12:39,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did well to make it
all the way here, kid.</font>

151
00:12:39,670 --> 00:12:41,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Allow me to congratulate you.</font>

152
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:45,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're really quite amazing, so much
that I would like you in our army.</font>

153
00:12:47,210 --> 00:12:49,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who would want to work with you?!</font>

154
00:12:49,980 --> 00:12:56,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">General White, please
stop doing bad things!</font>

155
00:12:56,050 --> 00:13:02,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So the traitorous, poorly constructed
machine asks like a big shot.</font>

156
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:07,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please, Son Goku is very strong.</font>

157
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:12,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So please surrender!</font>

158
00:13:15,010 --> 00:13:19,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop it, Ha-<i>chan</i>! It doesn't
matter <i>what</i> you say to this guy!</font>

159
00:13:19,850 --> 00:13:23,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aren't you the ones
who should surrender?</font>

160
00:13:51,570 --> 00:13:54,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry! Son Goku, are you dead?</font>

161
00:14:04,950 --> 00:14:07,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This is...</font>

162
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:13,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What happened?</font>

163
00:14:13,650 --> 00:14:18,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We fell through a trap
door to the 5th floor.</font>

164
00:14:19,500 --> 00:14:22,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The 5th floor?</font>

165
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:28,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is this place?</font>

166
00:14:33,170 --> 00:14:35,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I do not know.</font>

167
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:39,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I only heard that the 5th
floor is a mysterious room.</font>

168
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:42,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a joke.</font>

169
00:14:42,810 --> 00:14:47,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kid, if you don't wanna die,
then you'll do as I say!</font>

170
00:14:47,510 --> 00:14:50,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Damn you...</font>

171
00:14:50,980 --> 00:14:57,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hand over your Dragon Ball and
the radar you used to look for it!</font>

172
00:14:57,020 --> 00:15:00,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hell, no! Like anybody
would give you anything!</font>

173
00:15:01,930 --> 00:15:04,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought it would come to this.</font>

174
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:13,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll just sit here and
watch you on the monitor</font>

175
00:15:13,010 --> 00:15:17,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">as you turn into a pile
of bones and roll around.</font>

176
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:19,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He closed it!</font>

177
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's starting?</font>

178
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:30,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku, were you also collecting
the Dragon Balls for a bad reason?</font>

179
00:15:30,010 --> 00:15:37,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No! I'm looking for them because one
of them is a memento from my grandpa.</font>

180
00:15:37,010 --> 00:15:38,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That is a relief.</font>

181
00:15:38,610 --> 00:15:41,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You really are nice, Son Goku.</font>

182
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:49,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What the...?!</font>

183
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:51,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-The wall is opening up!</font>

184
00:16:03,970 --> 00:16:06,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is something inside! Be careful!</font>

185
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:35,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku!</font>

186
00:16:42,570 --> 00:16:47,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kid! It's the end of the line
when you're up against Buyon!</font>

187
00:16:47,070 --> 00:16:49,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Prepare to be eaten!</font>

188
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:53,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't be eaten by this thing!</font>

189
00:16:57,750 --> 00:17:01,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku! I am... scared.</font>

190
00:17:01,650 --> 00:17:06,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What for? I'll take
care of him with one hit!</font>

191
00:17:06,090 --> 00:17:10,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're quite naive, kid. No matter how
good you are or what weapons you have,</font>

192
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you stand no chance against Buyon!</font>

193
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:44,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way! My punches
have no effect at all!</font>

194
00:17:44,470 --> 00:17:46,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, in that case...</font>

195
00:17:46,690 --> 00:17:50,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Try a kick!</font>

196
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:01,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Are you okay, Son Goku?</font>

197
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">O-Ow!</font>

198
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This isn't good!</font>

199
00:18:06,590 --> 00:18:12,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His body is so soft and flabby--
I can't use punches <i>or</i> kicks!</font>

200
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:14,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it! That can't be!</font>

201
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One more time!</font>

202
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:31,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku! Do not die!
Please do not die!</font>

203
00:18:32,650 --> 00:18:35,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I'm okay, it was nothing...</font>

204
00:18:47,650 --> 00:18:50,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">S-Son Goku!</font>

205
00:18:57,290 --> 00:18:59,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad, kid!</font>

206
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:46,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good for you! Good for you!</font>

207
00:19:46,070 --> 00:19:48,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Man, that was close!</font>

208
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:51,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just a little bit more and
I woulda been swallowed!</font>

209
00:19:52,910 --> 00:19:54,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stubborn little brat!</font>

210
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:03,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're not getting me with that again!</font>

211
00:20:19,670 --> 00:20:23,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I'm in real trouble now.
All I'm doing is running away...</font>

212
00:20:23,010 --> 00:20:26,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What can I do to beat him?</font>

213
00:20:33,350 --> 00:20:36,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku, you are quite exhausted...</font>

214
00:20:36,090 --> 00:20:38,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. Hungry, too...</font>

215
00:20:40,690 --> 00:20:45,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! The <i>Kamehameha</i>! Okay!</font>

216
00:20:45,130 --> 00:20:47,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stand back, Ha-<i>chan</i>!</font>

217
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:54,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I didn't wanna use this 'cuz I get
even hungrier every time I use it, but...</font>

218
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:56,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...l'll put an end to you with this!</font>

219
00:20:58,460 --> 00:21:00,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Ka</i>...</font>

220
00:21:00,660 --> 00:21:02,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

221
00:21:02,430 --> 00:21:04,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

222
00:21:04,270 --> 00:21:05,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

223
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:08,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

224
00:21:30,490 --> 00:21:32,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

225
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:38,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way! Even the <i>Kamehameha</i>...?!</font>

226
00:21:42,340 --> 00:21:44,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the matter, kid? Is that it?</font>

227
00:21:44,540 --> 00:21:47,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">May I give you one last chance?</font>

228
00:21:47,140 --> 00:21:51,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you hand over the Dragon
Ball and radar, I'll save you!</font>

229
00:21:51,150 --> 00:21:56,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Didn't I already tell you I'm not gonna die?!</font>

230
00:21:56,320 --> 00:21:58,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stubborn fool!</font>

231
00:21:58,190 --> 00:22:01,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll let you die just as you wish!</font>

232
00:22:01,190 --> 00:22:04,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll just look for the Dragon
Ball and radar afterwards!</font>

233
00:22:04,890 --> 00:22:08,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't hold back, Buyon!
Slaughter the both of 'em!</font>

234
00:22:09,190 --> 00:22:10,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Crap!</font>

235
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:12,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Buyon! Kill 'em!</font>

236
00:22:16,130 --> 00:22:18,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>...!</font>

237
00:22:18,130 --> 00:22:19,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>!</font>

238
00:22:19,970 --> 00:22:22,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>! Ha-<i>chan</i>!</font>

239
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you okay?!</font>

240
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:33,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you, Son Goku!</font>

241
00:22:54,730 --> 00:22:58,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have no choice. I'll ram
into you with everything I got!</font>

242
00:22:58,670 --> 00:23:00,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I go!</font>

243
00:23:00,010 --> 00:23:03,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Assault!</font>

244
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:17,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We are done for, Son Goku.</font>

245
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:19,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There is nothing we can do...</font>

246
00:23:22,590 --> 00:23:24,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't talk so pathetically, Ha-<i>chan</i>!</font>

247
00:23:24,930 --> 00:23:28,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Men can't give up!</font>

248
00:23:28,730 --> 00:23:31,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But...</font>

249
00:23:31,630 --> 00:23:36,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You bastard! Laugh it up
while you still can!</font>

250
00:23:36,130 --> 00:23:40,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But there really <i>isn't</i> anything we can do.</font>

251
00:23:40,070 --> 00:23:42,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If only his body wasn't so soft and flabby...</font>

252
00:23:42,710 --> 00:23:47,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It'd be a cinch if his
body were hard... Dammit...</font>

253
00:23:47,780 --> 00:23:48,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait a sec.</font>

254
00:23:48,980 --> 00:23:52,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You were frozen solid!</font>

255
00:23:52,020 --> 00:23:54,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Frozen? What's that?</font>

256
00:23:54,420 --> 00:23:58,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's where you're so cold
you turn hard like ice.</font>

257
00:24:00,090 --> 00:24:03,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see! Hard!</font>

258
00:24:03,460 --> 00:24:06,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's it! Yeah!</font>

259
00:24:06,900 --> 00:24:09,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What is going on, Son Goku?</font>

260
00:24:12,300 --> 00:24:17,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! <i>I'm</i> gonna win this fight!</font>

261
00:24:20,510 --> 00:24:22,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?! Can't you just admit defeat?!</font>

262
00:24:22,780 --> 00:24:25,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be sputtering such nonsense!</font>

263
00:24:25,150 --> 00:24:28,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It isn't nonsense! Just you watch!</font>

264
00:24:36,660 --> 00:24:38,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

265
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:43,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright!</font>

266
00:24:49,670 --> 00:24:53,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>, is coldness a problem for you?</font>

267
00:24:53,510 --> 00:24:56,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Coldness is no problem for me.</font>

268
00:24:56,150 --> 00:24:59,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's great! Let me inside your coat!</font>

269
00:24:59,320 --> 00:25:01,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's unbearably cold!</font>

270
00:25:35,290 --> 00:25:37,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now he's all hard!</font>

271
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:41,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excellent thinking, Son Goku!</font>

272
00:25:42,530 --> 00:25:44,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that he's hard, it's time for this!</font>

273
00:25:54,370 --> 00:25:55,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">C-Cold!</font>

274
00:26:17,930 --> 00:26:19,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We did it!</font>

275
00:26:21,970 --> 00:26:24,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Who <i>is</i> he?!</font>

276
00:26:24,900 --> 00:26:26,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now for the next one...</font>

277
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:41,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's nice and warm here!</font>

278
00:26:42,820 --> 00:26:44,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Nyoibou</i>, extend!</font>

279
00:26:48,930 --> 00:26:51,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ha-<i>chan</i>, hold onto this pole!</font>

280
00:26:53,600 --> 00:26:56,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hold on tight!</font>

281
00:26:56,630 --> 00:26:58,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Nyoibou</i>, revert!</font>

282
00:27:06,510 --> 00:27:09,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fool! Dropping your guard like that...!</font>

283
00:27:13,740 --> 00:27:17,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That hurts!</font>

284
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:19,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can I ask you a question?</font>

285
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:22,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-The bullets hit you, didn't they?</font>

286
00:27:22,250 --> 00:27:25,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They did! And they really hurt!</font>

287
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:27,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna make you hurt twice as much!</font>

288
00:27:29,590 --> 00:27:32,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you once again, Son Goku!</font>

289
00:27:32,760 --> 00:27:36,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This can't be happening!</font>

290
00:27:36,300 --> 00:27:41,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now give back the village chief
if you don't wanna get sent flying!</font>

291
00:27:41,600 --> 00:27:46,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Goku has finally climbed his way</i>
<i>to the top floor of Muscle Tower.</i></font>

292
00:27:46,670 --> 00:27:52,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The final struggle to the death</i>
<i>with General White begins at last!</i></font>

293
00:28:14,770 --> 00:28:17,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

294
00:28:14,770 --> 00:28:17,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

295
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:20,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

296
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:20,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

297
00:28:20,270 --> 00:28:26,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

298
00:28:20,270 --> 00:28:26,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

299
00:28:26,810 --> 00:28:29,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

300
00:28:26,810 --> 00:28:29,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

301
00:28:29,820 --> 00:28:32,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

302
00:28:29,820 --> 00:28:32,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

303
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:38,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

304
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:38,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

305
00:28:38,330 --> 00:28:44,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

306
00:28:38,330 --> 00:28:44,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

307
00:28:44,330 --> 00:28:50,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

308
00:28:44,330 --> 00:28:50,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

309
00:28:50,500 --> 00:29:01,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

310
00:28:50,500 --> 00:29:01,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

311
00:29:01,650 --> 00:29:09,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

312
00:29:01,650 --> 00:29:09,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

313
00:29:09,190 --> 00:29:13,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

314
00:29:09,190 --> 00:29:13,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

315
00:29:13,690 --> 00:29:21,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

316
00:29:13,690 --> 00:29:21,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

317
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:29,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

318
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:29,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

